      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“哦！那可得把咱们修理屋的招牌擦亮了！”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 4,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“放心！今天只介绍，不拆东西！”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 11,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“我是修理师！怎么说得我只会拆一样！”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 1,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“先从故事开始！这回也有咱们出场的篇章\n　哦。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 8,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“那当然得看看。\n　别一上来就把后面的事全说了。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 4,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“知道啦！精彩的，留给大家自己玩。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 1,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“想动脑筋，就去挑战任务；想看招式，\n　就去战斗鉴赏。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 8,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“对手、武器挑好了，就痛痛快快看一场！”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 8,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“那些出击、合体的场面，也能挑出来再看？”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 4,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“能！这次还加上了名场面集。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 8,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“好！修理师偶尔也得看看，\n　人家怎么合起来的。”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 1,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "只看演出，按圆圈；连对白一起重温，就按三角。演出中可以退出，对话时不行哦。",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 1,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "本篇原关卡里的这些事件演出，也加上中文字幕了。",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 1,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "right",
      "name": "梅尔",
      "text": "“达令，介绍也得抓紧点。后面还排着队呢！”",
      "font": "native",
      "fontSize": 24
    },
    {
      "background": 88,
      "left": {
        "character": 713,
        "expression": 8,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "right": {
        "character": 715,
        "expression": 0,
        "mirror": false,
        "direction": "auto",
        "light": "auto",
        "scale": 100
      },
      "speaker": "left",
      "name": "兰德",
      "text": "“打仗的时候想快一点，\n　也有办法——按住方块！”",
